 P365XL/X-Macro Recoil Spring Assembly.'', ''17-4 stainless'', NULL, ''Machined from 17-4 stainless billet rather than the factory MIM slide, the Velocity V1 adds a dual-cut optic footprint that accepts a wide range of micro red dots plus E.G.F. texturing for a more secure grip when racking. Made in the USA to tight tolerances, it drops onto a stock P365XL/X-Macro frame with no custom fitting, giving owners a stronger, more capable slide.'', ''{}'', FALSE) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, url=EXCLUDED.url, fitment_confidence=EXCLUDED.fitment_confidence, build_warning=EXCLUDED.build_warning, fitment_notes=EXCLUDED.fitment_notes, build_notes=EXCLUDED.build_notes, material=EXCLUDED.material, weight_oz=EXCLUDED.weight_oz, description=EXCLUDED.description, is_discontinued=EXCLUDED.is_discontinued, updated_at=now(); INSERT INTO products (slug, category, brand_id, name, url, fitment_confidence, build_warning, fitment_notes, build_notes, material, weight_oz, description, best_for, is_discontinued) VALUES (''norsso-bentham-p365'', ''slide'', (SELECT id FROM manufacturers WHERE slug = ''norsso''), ''Norsso P365 Bentham'', ''https://norsso.com/p365-bentham/'', ''verified''::fitment_confidence, NULL, ''Compatible with P365 3.1\" barrels ONLY. 3.7\" barrels NOT compatible. Threaded barrels are compatible.'', ''Fits any P365 frame. On XL/XMacro frame requires P365XL/X-Macro Recoil Spring Assembly.'', ''17-4 stainless'', NULL, ''Bentham strips away window cuts for a clean, understated profile machined from 17-4 stainless billet and heat treated to H900, giving the P365 a noticeably lighter, more refined feel than the factory slide. It''''s a strong OEM replacement for owners who want the material and machining upgrade of an aftermarket slide without an aggressive tactical look.'', ''{}'', FALSE) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, url=EXCLUDED.url, fitment_confidence=EXCLUDED.fitment_confidence, build_warning=EXCLUDED.build_warning, fitment_notes=EXCLUDED.fitment_notes, build_notes=EXCLUDED.build_notes, material=EXCLUDED.material, weight_oz=EXCLUDED.weight_oz, description=EXCLUDED.description, is_discontinued=EXCLUDED.is_discontinued, updated_at=now(); INSERT INTO products (slug, category, brand_id, name, url, fitment_confidence, build_warning, fitment_notes, build_notes, material, weight_oz, description, best_for, is_discontinued) VALUES (''norsso-rail-edc-p365'', ''slide'', (SELECT id FROM manufacturers WHERE slug = ''norsso''), ''Norsso P365 Rail EDC'', ''https://norsso.com/slides/p365-rail-edc/'', ''verified''::fitment_confidence, NULL, ''Compatible with P365 3.1\" barrels ONLY. 3.7\" barrels NOT compatible. Threaded barrels are compatible.'', ''Fits any P365 frame. On XL/XMacro frame requires P365XL/X-Macro Recoil Spring Assembly.'', ''17-4 stainless'', NULL, ''The Rail EDC pairs Norsso''''s billet 17-4 stainless construction with forward and rear serrations sized for everyday carry, replacing the factory slide''''s softer MIM material and shallow cocking cuts. It''''s a solid choice for shooters who want a tougher, better-gripping slide for a duty-style carry gun without extra machining features like porting.'', ''{}'', FALSE) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, url=EXCLUDED.url, fitment_confidence=EXCLUDED.fitment_confidence, build_warning=EXCLUDED.build_warning, fitment_notes=EXCLUDED.fitment_notes, build_notes=EXCLUDED.build_notes, material=EXCLUDED.material, weight_oz=EXCLUDED.weight_oz, description=EXCLUDED.description, is_discontinued=EXCLUDED.is_discontinued, updated_at=now(); INSERT INTO products (slug, category, brand_id, name, url, fitment_confidence, build_warning, fitment_notes, build_notes, material, weight_oz, description, best_for, is_discontinued) VALUES (''norsso-reptile-edc-p365'', ''slide'', (SELECT id FROM manufacturers WHERE slug = ''norsso''), ''Norsso P365 Reptile EDC'', ''https://norsso.com/p365-reptile-edc/'', ''verified''::fitment_confidence, NULL, ''Compatible with P365 3.1\" barrels ONLY. 3.7\" barrels NOT compatible. Threaded barrels are compatible.'', ''Fits any P365 frame. On XL/XMacro frame requires P365XL/X-Macro Recoil Spring Assembly.'', ''17-4 stainless'', NULL, ''The Reptile EDC brings Norsso''''s signature deep, scale-like side texturing to a carry-focused cut, offering far more purchase for slide manipulation than the smooth factory OEM slide. Built from heat-treated 17-4 stainless billet, it''''s a durable, better-handling replacement aimed at everyday carry rather than range/duty aesthetics.'', ''{}'', FALSE) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, url=EXCLUDED.url, fitment_confidence=EXCLUDED.fitment_confidence, build_warning=EXCLUDED.build_warning, fitment_notes=EXCLUDED.fitment_notes, build_notes=EXCLUDED.build_notes, material=EXCLUDED.material, weight_oz=EXCLUDED.weight_oz, description=EXCLUDED.description, is_discontinued=EXCLUDED.is_discontinued, updated_at=now(); INSERT INTO products (slug, category, brand_id, name, url, fitment_confidence, build_warning, fitment_notes, build_notes, material, weight_oz, description, best_for, is_discontinued) VALUES (''norsso-reptile-og-p365'', ''slide'', (SELECT id FROM manufacturers WHERE slug = ''norsso''), ''Norsso P365 Reptile OG'', ''https://norsso.com/p365-reptile/'', ''verified''::fitment_confidence, NULL, ''Compatible with P365 3.1\" barrels ONLY. 3.7\" barrels NOT compatible. Threaded barrels are compatible.'', ''Fits any P365 frame. On XL/XMacro frame requires P365XL/X-Macro Recoil Spring Assembly.'', ''17-4 stainless'', NULL, ''Reptile OG is Norsso''''s original design, using CNC-surfaced 3D side windows along with forward and top serrations for easier press-checks and slide racking than the stock slide allows. Machined from 17-4 stainless and heat treated to H900, it''''s a proven, well-reviewed upgrade for owners who want both weight savings and an aggressive, distinctive look.'', ''{}'', FALSE) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXC