barrels are compatible.'', ''Fits any P365XL/XMacro frame requires P365XL/X-Macro Recoil Spring Assembly.'', ''17-4 stainless'', NULL, ''The XL Rail slide adds side window cuts and Norsso''''s precision 17-4 stainless machining to the P365XL, offering better slide-racking grip and a lighter feel than the stock slide. It''''s a dependable, no-frills OEM replacement for owners upgrading an XL for carry or range use.'', ''{}'', FALSE) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, url=EXCLUDED.url, fitment_confidence=EXCLUDED.fitment_confidence, build_warning=EXCLUDED.build_warning, fitment_notes=EXCLUDED.fitment_notes, build_notes=EXCLUDED.build_notes, material=EXCLUDED.material, weight_oz=EXCLUDED.weight_oz, description=EXCLUDED.description, is_discontinued=EXCLUDED.is_discontinued, updated_at=now(); INSERT INTO products (slug, category, brand_id, name, url, fitment_confidence, build_warning, fitment_notes, build_notes, material, weight_oz, description, best_for, is_discontinued) VALUES (''norsso-rail-edc-p365-xl'', ''slide'', (SELECT id FROM manufacturers WHERE slug = ''norsso''), ''Norsso P365XL Rail EDC'', ''https://norsso.com/slides/sig-p365-365xl/p365xl/p365xl-rail-edc/'', ''verified''::fitment_confidence, NULL, ''Compatible with P365XL 3.7\" barrels ONLY. 3.1\" barrels NOT compatible. Threaded barrels are compatible.'', ''Fits any P365XL/XMacro frame requires P365XL/X-Macro Recoil Spring Assembly.'', ''17-4 stainless'', NULL, ''Rail EDC for the XL brings the same billet 17-4 stainless build and carry-oriented serration pattern as the standard-frame version, sized correctly for the XL''''s 3.7\" barrel. It''''s a straightforward upgrade for XL owners who want a tougher, better-gripping slide without window cuts or porting.'', ''{}'', FALSE) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, url=EXCLUDED.url, fitment_confidence=EXCLUDED.fitment_confidence, build_warning=EXCLUDED.build_warning, fitment_notes=EXCLUDED.fitment_notes, build_notes=EXCLUDED.bui